usage: csk config build-ssh doctor [-h] [--all-os] [--identity PATH]
                                   [--agent SOCKET]
                                   [scope]

positional arguments:
  scope            scope or canonical repository identity

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --all-os         include macOS, Linux and Windows steps
  --identity PATH  inspect this identity instead of the configured selection
  --agent SOCKET   inspect this agent socket (or auto)
